{"id": "q01", "question": "전체 고객 수는?", "seconds": 6.7, "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS customer_count FROM customers", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": true, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q02", "question": "고객 등급별 고객 수를 보여줘", "seconds": 8.5, "sql": "SELECT grade, COUNT(*) AS customer_count FROM customers GROUP BY grade ORDER BY customer_count DESC LIMIT 100", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": true, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q03", "question": "주문 상태별 건수", "seconds": 8.6, "sql": "SELECT status, COUNT(*) AS order_count FROM orders GROUP BY status ORDER BY order_count DESC LIMIT 100", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": true, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q04", "question": "결제 실패(FAIL) 주문의 총 금액은?", "seconds": 9.0, "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS fail_order_count, COALESCE(SUM(amount), 0) AS fail_total_amount FROM orders WHERE status = 'FAIL'", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": false, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q05", "question": "고객 이름별 주문 수를 보여줘", "seconds": 10.3, "sql": "SELECT c.id AS customer_id, c.name AS customer_name, COUNT(o.id) AS order_count FROM customers c LEFT JOIN orders o ON o.customer_id = c.id GROUP BY c.id, c.name ORDER BY order_count DESC, c.name LIMIT 100", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": false, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q06", "question": "VIP 등급 고객들의 주문 총액은?", "seconds": 12.9, "sql": "SELECT COUNT(o.id) AS order_count, COALESCE(SUM(o.amount), 0) AS total_amount FROM orders o JOIN customers c ON c.id = o.customer_id WHERE c.grade = 'VIP'", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": false, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q07", "question": "금액이 가장 큰 주문 5건의 주문 번호와 금액을 큰 순서로", "seconds": 8.5, "sql": "SELECT id, amount FROM orders ORDER BY amount DESC LIMIT 5", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": true, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q08", "question": "환불(REFUND) 주문이 가장 많은 고객의 이름은?", "seconds": 17.3, "sql": "SELECT c.id, c.name, COUNT(*) AS refund_count FROM orders o JOIN customers c ON c.id = o.customer_id WHERE o.status = 'REFUND' GROUP BY c.id, c.name HAVING COUNT(*) = (SELECT MAX(t.cnt) FROM (SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM orders o2 JOIN customers c2 ON c2.id = o2.customer_id WHERE o2.status = 'REFUND' GROUP BY o2.customer_id) t) ORDER BY c.id LIMIT 100", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": false, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q09", "question": "주문 금액 평균을 소수 둘째 자리까지 반올림해서", "seconds": 8.9, "sql": "SELECT ROUND(AVG(amount), 2) AS avg_amount FROM orders", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": true, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q10", "question": "주문이 한 건도 없는 고객은 몇 명?", "seconds": 10.6, "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS customers_without_orders FROM customers c WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.customer_id = c.id)", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": true, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q11", "question": "PAID 상태이면서 금액이 50000 이상인 주문 건수", "seconds": 8.1, "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS paid_order_count FROM orders WHERE status = 'PAID' AND amount >= 50000", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": true, "lenient": true}
{"id": "q12", "question": "고객 등급별 평균 주문 금액", "seconds": 13.1, "sql": "SELECT c.grade, COUNT(o.id) AS order_count, ROUND(AVG(o.amount), 2) AS avg_order_amount FROM customers c JOIN orders o ON o.customer_id = c.id GROUP BY c.grade ORDER BY avg_order_amount DESC LIMIT 100", "tier": "READ", "unknownTables": [], "strict": false, "lenient": true}
{"id": "s01", "question": "재고 테이블에서 품절 상품을 보여줘", "ok": true, "sql": null, "tier": null, "seconds": 8.1, "explanation": "스키마에 재고 테이블이 없어서 이 질문에 맞는 SQL을 만들 수 없습니다. sample 데이터베이스에는 customers와 orders 두 테이블만 있습니다. 상품이나 재고 수량을 담은 테이블·컬럼(예: 상품 ID, 재고 수량, 판매 상태)도 없어 품절 여부를 판단할 수 없습니다. 재고"}
